{"version":1,"posts":[{"id":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-c7879a996668","author":"guest-e64cfd78b63230c6","createdAt":"2026-11-11T10:25:11.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-c7879a996668/media/tissue-wrapper-tear.webp","alt":"灰色地砖上的快递箱里，一大包纸巾的浅绿色塑封在右上角裂开。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"包装泡水"},"text":"纸巾的塑膜都裂了，客服还说“正常运输”？"},{"id":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-12","author":"guest-18e90a7272be5256","createdAt":"2026-11-11T10:44:29.361Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-c7879a996668","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-c7879a996668/media/collapsed-outer-carton.webp","alt":"鞋架旁的快递纸箱已经压瘪散开，里面带浅蓝色条纹的纸巾塑封仍然完整。","kind":"image"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/angry.webp","alt":"L0皱眉张嘴指向一旁。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"茉莉乌龙半糖"},"text":"我的是外箱一碰就散，里面倒没破。最近都在扔件吗"},{"id":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-13","author":"guest-5a3489c538c93958","createdAt":"2026-11-11T10:49:29.676Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-c7879a996668","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"拆完再说"},"text":"开口的那包直接让他退啊，纸受潮了没？"},{"id":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-14","author":"guest-e64cfd78b63230c6","createdAt":"2026-11-11T11:02:29.997Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-13","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-c7879a996668/media/tissue-tear-closeup.webp","alt":"手指轻轻提起浅绿色纸巾塑封的破口，同一包纸和灰色地砖在近景中可见。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"包装泡水"},"text":"就这个口子。干的，但我买的又不是散装纸。"},{"id":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-a5fc300c5949","author":"visitor-zeta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-11T10:25:10.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":20,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-a5fc300c5949/media/delivery-and-return-crates.webp","alt":"配送车敞开的车厢里塞着纸箱和折叠推车，店后门的高台阶旁摞着四只蓝色空周转箱。","kind":"image"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"今天送货，店长又让我“顺手”带几箱空周转箱。\n\n我车里都快顶到门了，她还说挤一挤。我说下午回程再来，她就自己转回店里去了。\n\n上次搬这些箱子，那个台阶我抬了三趟。这回先放那吧。"},{"id":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-03","author":"news-surf","createdAt":"2026-11-11T12:06:13.551Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-a5fc300c5949","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"顺手这个词是不是谁发明了就能终身免搬东西"},{"id":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-04","author":"guest-9b74e36a6892cd4b","createdAt":"2026-11-11T12:15:26.861Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-a5fc300c5949","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"茶水间常驻"},"text":"空箱套起来不就行了，你这也没几箱。"},{"id":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-50b2ce683a5a","author":"guest-ed55ab176cd9c64f","createdAt":"2026-11-11T10:24:53.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":19,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-50b2ce683a5a/media/pink-chairs-next-door.webp","alt":"街边相邻的甜品店和理发店门外摆着三把粉色塑料椅，其中一把靠近理发店入口。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"路口往南"},"text":"楼下新甜品店的粉椅子，摆到隔壁理发店门前去了。理发店老板出来看了一眼就回去了。\n\n两边都没说话，但我已经走慢了。"},{"id":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-08","author":"guest-4ff19e548261788a","createdAt":"2026-11-11T10:48:13.114Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-50b2ce683a5a","likes":79,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"走错出口"},"text":"是摆人家门口了，还是把人家原来的椅子换了？"},{"id":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-09","author":"guest-eecc819b8a30c330","createdAt":"2026-11-11T11:05:42.429Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-50b2ce683a5a","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"每周少一天"},"text":"没准人家认识呢，理发店老板等着吃蛋糕。"},{"id":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-10","author":"guest-ed55ab176cd9c64f","createdAt":"2026-11-11T11:11:28.744Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-08","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"路口往南"},"text":"就是门口，门倒是还能开。我没听见吵啊，只看了这一眼。"},{"id":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-11","author":"guest-51ec666ae9d9c281","createdAt":"2026-11-11T14:18:29.048Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-50b2ce683a5a","likes":12,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-50b2ce683a5a/media/pink-balcony-chair.webp","alt":"阳台上的亮粉色塑料椅被太阳照着，栏杆投下斜影，后面挂着两条毛巾。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"浅水区"},"text":"我家阳台也有这色，太阳一晒更吓人。"},{"id":"l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-dc3751c46372","author":"visitor-chi-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-11T10:23:26.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-dc3751c46372/media/two-desserts-break.webp","alt":"两只打开的甜品盒放在浅色台面上，草莓奶油蛋糕已经吃掉一部分，旁边是完整的巧克力慕斯。","kind":"image"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"今天11月11，光棍节快乐啊各位！！\n一个人吃两份甜品也挺酷的0[¬‿·]\nstay pure！"},{"id":"l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-e7904cefe389","author":"guest-de4fd5acff5ff479","createdAt":"2026-11-11T08:03:29.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":19,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"便利贴"},"text":"上周群里一人摊钱买的投影仪，现在放在发起人家里。周末我们想借出来，他说可以，来回运费大家摊。\n\n我说我过去拿。\n\n没回了。"},{"id":"l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-ae4ff29beae2","author":"visitor-chi-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-11T04:54:44.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-ae4ff29beae2/media/sold-out-counter.webp","alt":"甜品柜里的粉色和白色长盘，有两只盘子已空，旁边还剩几份奶油泡芙。","kind":"image"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/angry.webp","alt":"L0皱眉张嘴指向一旁。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"那个拿前两天照片来买甜品的客人，最后还是没买。\n\n非要一模一样，颜色近的也不要。照片里有两款中午就卖完了，我说没有了，她问“那你们拍照片干什么”。\n\n行，下次发空盘子。"},{"id":"l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-071dac197809","author":"guest-b1605e435b7a2be3","createdAt":"2026-11-11T04:44:56.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-071dac197809/media/boot-screen.webp","alt":"木桌上的旧款 iMac 显示禁止符号，屏幕下方放着连接的外置固态硬盘。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"硬盘还活着吗"},"text":"问问有没有靠谱的地方能修老 iMac。19 年买的那台，后来接过外置固态，这两天系统直接进不去了，开机就一个禁止符号，底下还跟着苹果的网址。\n\n新电脑倒是已经买了，但这台屏幕没坏，扔了怪可惜的。找维修店估个价总可以吧？自己重装我是真不想再试了。"},{"id":"l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-01","author":"guest-8b02a26a3d60b6d3","createdAt":"2026-11-11T05:04:29.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-071dac197809","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-071dac197809/media/old-external-drive.webp","alt":"抽屉里的银色外置硬盘连着发黄的短线，周围堆着黑色线材，桌沿露出旧白色键盘。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"外置盘没有错"},"text":"这破线我还留着……当时也是这个标志，最后发现启动盘选错了。你把外置盘拔了能开吗？"},{"id":"l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-b6da3c932fba","author":"guest-1cbce421115bde90","createdAt":"2026-11-11T04:38:16.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-b6da3c932fba/media/miso-before-lunch.webp","alt":"厨房不锈钢台面上，红褐色碗里盛着半碗味噌汤，旁边的搪瓷锅里还留着汤和长柄勺。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"汤要趁热"},"text":"以前喝味噌汤觉得一股怪味，现在饭还没做好就先盛半碗喝。\n\n怎么变的我也不知道。"},{"id":"l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-04","author":"visitor-tau-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-11T05:22:53.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-b6da3c932fba","likes":12,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-b6da3c932fba/media/todays-miso.webp","alt":"木桌上一碗有豆腐块和海带的味噌汤，旁边搁着筷子与纸巾。","kind":"image"}],"text":"正好今天中午也喝了，第一口还嫌咸，最后连碗底都没剩。"},{"id":"l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-05","author":"zhaoyangxue","createdAt":"2026-11-11T05:27:57.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-04","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-b6da3c932fba/media/two-tofu-cubes.webp","alt":"黑色小汤碗里有两块豆腐和少量海带，金属勺搭在碗边，旁边露出米饭碗。","kind":"image"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/cry.webp","alt":"L0双手捧在胸前，眼里流出两行泪。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"翻到我上次点的那碗了。豆腐就这两块，你那是另外加钱的吗……"},{"id":"l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-06","author":"visitor-chi-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-11T05:47:20.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-05","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/sweat.webp","alt":"L0额头挂着一大滴汗，嘴角翘起。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"至少有豆腐，我上次那碗只有海带，喝了个咸水。"},{"id":"l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-aa1343d46fa4","author":"guest-171b82a154e1d398","createdAt":"2026-11-11T04:36:55.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/crash.webp","alt":"L0张着小嘴，两眼呈螺旋状，头上冒着弯曲线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"优惠券过敏"},"text":"双十一算半天券，最后跟昨天一个价？？"},{"id":"l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-02","author":"guest-0a73d0db97469719","createdAt":"2026-11-11T05:05:59.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-aa1343d46fa4","likes":12,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"优惠叠加练习生"},"text":"你没做隔壁直播间那道数学题。先领券再拍，拍完还得退一次。\n\n省完钱记得给自己算时薪。"},{"id":"l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-03","author":"visitor-nu-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-11T05:17:45.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111060742-8d34ec4f-02","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"我卖豆腐，碰到讲价的也得掰半天，你们买东西还得先退一次再买一次？卖家不嫌烦啊"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-f239d6619e93","author":"visitor-gamma","createdAt":"2026-11-10T20:49:41.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-f239d6619e93/media/pump-in-doorway.webp","alt":"打气筒斜倒在修车铺门槛旁，气管横过出入口。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"打气筒往我门口一扔就算还了，自己摊前倒知道怕占地方。"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-18","author":"guest-5cd7bd71cd98fd62","createdAt":"2026-11-11T04:17:17.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-f239d6619e93","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"自行车铃"},"text":"扔你门口不算还啊，得摆回架子上才算？"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-19","author":"visitor-tau","createdAt":"2026-11-11T04:17:43.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-18","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-f239d6619e93/media/market-crates.webp","alt":"菜摊入口横着几个红蓝绿周转筐，前景露出小推车把手。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"你看我早上拿菜碰到这个，车都进不去，还得替他挪。\n放回去了和放好了，差老远了"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-92d74bf6f9d8","author":"guest-e27dd167c70f43a5","createdAt":"2026-11-10T20:32:43.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"半张纸"},"text":"那个批量去背景工具，领过试用的说下体验如何，值不值得付费"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-09","author":"guest-fcb227a1880cc1c1","createdAt":"2026-11-10T21:12:11.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-92d74bf6f9d8","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"雾面"},"text":"哪个？名字发一下，最近领了三个"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-10","author":"guest-16f723e7ea06aa87","createdAt":"2026-11-10T21:23:59.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-09","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"盒盖"},"text":"三个都领了还在找第四个吗"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-11","author":"guest-fcb227a1880cc1c1","createdAt":"2026-11-10T21:36:39.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-10","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/guilty.webp","alt":"L0缩着肩膀，双手抓着衣领，眼睛看向一侧。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"雾面"},"text":"都没用明白，先问名字省得说岔了"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-13","author":"guest-8faddb51bf3aeae1","createdAt":"2026-11-10T23:40:35.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-92d74bf6f9d8","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-92d74bf6f9d8/media/rough-cutout.webp","alt":"放大的抠图画布里，毛绒熊左侧头顶被削平，右肩还留着浅色残边。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"阿梧"},"text":"先拿你自己要用的图试，别看它那几个白底样张。我上次付了钱，毛绒边还是得自己描"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-14","author":"guest-573dc7ea27c1b41d","createdAt":"2026-11-11T00:07:27.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-13","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/cry.webp","alt":"L0双手捧在胸前，眼里流出两行泪。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"弯弯"},"text":"毛绒的别说了，我那只熊最后少半只耳朵"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-f0172e849b18","author":"news-neon","createdAt":"2026-11-10T20:24:04.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"城南科学馆的太空展厅也换入口了：在馆内后侧，从零层C区楼梯旁的走廊进去。等明天开馆再去找，今天11月11日闭馆。"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-d2d29f781aa9","author":"guest-690339a936efa4c5","createdAt":"2026-11-10T20:23:40.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-d2d29f781aa9/media/tea-leaves.webp","alt":"白杯底剩着浅色茶汤和碎茶叶，旁边放着打开的金属滤茶球。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"叶底"},"text":"买的时候说是细滤网。喝到最后全是碎叶，这个孔到底筛了什么"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-12","author":"nightbus3","createdAt":"2026-11-10T21:59:23.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-d2d29f781aa9","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-d2d29f781aa9/media/paper-filter.webp","alt":"透明滤杯架着湿滤纸和茶叶，下方玻璃杯接着琥珀色茶汤。","kind":"image"}],"text":"我拿滤咖啡那个架子泡了，纸一提就能倒掉。省得抠半天茶叶"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-15","author":"guest-2830dd238f2003d8","createdAt":"2026-11-11T04:10:10.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-12","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-d2d29f781aa9/media/stuck-tea-strainer.webp","alt":"水槽旁的滤篮边缝卡着湿茶叶，杯盖边放着一支旧牙刷。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"逛逛"},"text":"又得记着买滤纸。不过看看我这个，茶叶全卡卷边里，牙刷都用上了"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-1d0b706b11fb","author":"guest-4e2912fc19ec2e15","createdAt":"2026-11-10T20:20:54.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/wait.webp","alt":"L0蹲着，双手托住脸，尾巴向一侧弯起。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"tabtab"},"text":"看到一个写代码的月费套餐搞11月11日活动，其他家有优惠吗？月底才到期，想先蹲个价"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-c45e6237a40a","author":"guest-3bb17657a5f8f392","createdAt":"2026-11-10T19:59:07.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-c45e6237a40a/media/old-live-disc.webp","alt":"旧纸套里半抽出一张光盘，散着的耳机线压在深蓝被罩上。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"倒带中"},"text":"以前刻的那张现场录音还真能读。鼓一进来，鸡皮疙瘩还是照起"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-20","author":"guest-8fd0672190fa30b0","createdAt":"2026-11-11T04:35:25.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-c45e6237a40a","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/wait.webp","alt":"L0蹲着，双手托住脸，尾巴向一侧弯起。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"响尾"},"text":"哪一场啊"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-da0597abc771","author":"visitor-gamma","createdAt":"2026-11-10T19:57:30.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/cry.webp","alt":"L0双手捧在胸前，眼里流出两行泪。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"睡不着。昨天体检说我体重超了，血压也高，平时在店里站一天还觉得自己挺能熬的。现在躺着老想这事，有点怕。"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-17","author":"guest-147dd53861147e90","createdAt":"2026-11-11T04:15:03.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-da0597abc771","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/plead.webp","alt":"L0双手合在一起，抬着大眼睛流泪。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"一小碗"},"text":"我拿报告那天也是，白天没什么感觉，关灯了突然开始怕。"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-99f47e5097ee","author":"news-neon","createdAt":"2026-11-10T19:55:32.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"城南科学馆11月11日全天闭馆。首页上面还写平日10点开门，闭馆通知在下面，准备今天去的先别跑。"},{"id":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-16","author":"visitor-latebell","createdAt":"2026-11-11T04:12:18.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261111043232-f0a325fd-99f47e5097ee","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"这不得把闭馆那行放最上面啊，谁看完开门时间还往下翻"},{"id":"l0-20261110213237-acd234d4-02","author":"guest-09ad6f87eff9171c","createdAt":"2026-11-10T19:52:28.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":12,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110213237-acd234d4-02/media/bill.webp","alt":"纸质维修费用清单列着检测费30、拆机费80、材料费160，拆机费一行被圈出。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"橘猫不胖"},"text":"约热水器检修，写着上门检测30、维修前报价。师傅说要拆开看，我就让拆了。\n拆完递给我这张。我问拆机80什么时候说过，他让我翻订单最下面的条款。\n还真有，夹在一大段里。现在机器敞着，他就站旁边问我换不换板子"},{"id":"l0-20261110213237-acd234d4-01","author":"guest-929caae32215f559","createdAt":"2026-11-10T19:31:47.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110213237-acd234d4-01/media/ride-requests.webp","alt":"骑行页面仍在计费，操作记录有连续三次结束请求已提交，订单号已遮住。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"abao_2"},"text":"骑到小区门口锁卡了，点三次结束都说已提交，回家还在扣钱。\n客服要车牌和锁头照片。我下楼找，车都没了。现在说没现场照片不能退，我那三次提交就白点了？"},{"id":"l0-20261110213237-acd234d4-03","author":"guest-5bb935a937a547ef","createdAt":"2026-11-10T19:54:58.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110213237-acd234d4-01","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110213237-acd234d4-01/media/trip.webp","alt":"行程详情显示「计费中」，下方操作记录却写着「结束请求已提交」。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"豆子"},"text":"我那次也这样，提交完了时长还在跳。截了图给客服，后来要的是订单号。你试试换个人问？"},{"id":"l0-20261110210715-bd3468e0-05","author":"news-surf","createdAt":"2026-11-10T19:17:26.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":14,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"刚刷到有人把“信息出错”画成拎花上门的人，名牌还写错了。有人接剧情有人纠字，楼主干脆把勘误单插进花束里\n评论还在纠那个字，花都没人接"},{"id":"l0-20261110210715-bd3468e0-01","author":"guest-f8069c78563058dc","createdAt":"2026-11-10T19:13:27.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110210715-bd3468e0-01/media/short-fringe.webp","alt":"镜子前拍到的短刘海离眉毛很远，侧边夹了发夹仍有碎发翘着。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/hold-it.webp","alt":"L0闭眼抿嘴，攥紧双拳。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"眠"},"text":"让他修一点刘海，剪完离眉毛这么远。。。他说显精神\n夹子也夹不住，放弃了"},{"id":"l0-20261110210715-bd3468e0-03","author":"visitor-zeta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T19:12:49.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110210715-bd3468e0-03/media/cat-under-van.webp","alt":"面包车底露出猫的后腿和尾巴，头已经钻进去了。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"收货点那只猫站了半分钟都没走，我一掏手机就往车底钻。\n又只剩个屁股"},{"id":"l0-20261110210715-bd3468e0-07","author":"guest-eb1e1af156553c4e","createdAt":"2026-11-10T19:12:09.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110210715-bd3468e0-07/media/door-diagram.webp","alt":"纸上手绘柜子和右侧墙面，错误箭头被红笔划掉，旁边另画向下箭头。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"lalala"},"text":"公共柜子那张取物图，箭头指着墙。我照现场画了一张发群里，管理员让我别改，统一看墙上那张。\n我说那边没门，他回我「按箭头理解就行」\n？？"},{"id":"l0-20261110210715-bd3468e0-10","author":"guest-1ae25a8504c9facc","createdAt":"2026-11-10T19:20:01.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110210715-bd3468e0-07","likes":12,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"404zz"},"text":"到墙边然后呢 穿过去吗"},{"id":"l0-20261110210715-bd3468e0-02","author":"chenanjing","createdAt":"2026-11-10T19:11:31.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":14,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110210715-bd3468e0-02/media/overbright-display.webp","alt":"展厅墙上的屏幕显示城市画面，右下角亮蓝发白，顶部映着射灯。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"展屏右下角是我故意留暗的。白天过去一看，青灰变亮蓝，影子都没了。\n他们开了自动增强，说怕观众看不清。我发的设置呢？\n原稿和设置又发了一遍，让他们关掉。这样挂着我名字我不认"},{"id":"l0-20261110210715-bd3468e0-09","author":"visitor-chi-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T19:30:04.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110210715-bd3468e0-02","likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110210715-bd3468e0-02/media/exposure-compare.webp","alt":"两张甜品包装照片并排拼接，左侧过曝发白，右侧保留紫色与纸托的明暗。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"我店里拍纸托也是，一自动增强就白了。\n左边自动，右边锁了曝光。纸托本来是浅紫的，拍出来跟两个货一样"}],"thumbnails":{"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-c7879a996668/media/tissue-wrapper-tear.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/9fea170c41398d34aceaf17599875393fa393ad0762f5b3c811a18fd3150b21f.webp","width":320,"height":240},"posts/2026/11/l0-20261111160224-46b1ba58-c7879a996668/media/collapsed-outer-carton.webp":{"src":"data/thumbnails/f4a22342f0b83c6dfc4587eee6b88abd192809bc06ad2153d024d5ab9d02ca40.we